    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Calling All Athletes!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to sprint, jump, slide, and wall run your way in Absolute Momentum! Race through the Skyline District as you boost your speed, jump through vents, and slide down waterfalls. Find hidden passages and alternate paths utilizing every parkour technique in your disposal!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Best of the Best</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race as one of our 5 champions,\u00a0Baku, Etoile, Sangeo, Bia, and Leilei!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Go for the Gold</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race up to 8 friends or randoms to decide who's the fastest athlete of all time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you maintain Absolute Momentum?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Calling All Athletes!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to sprint, jump, slide, and wall run your way in Absolute Momentum! Race through the Skyline District as you boost your speed, jump through vents, and slide down waterfalls. Find hidden passages and alternate paths utilizing every parkour technique in your disposal!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Best of the Best</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race as one of our 5 champions,\u00a0Baku, Etoile, Sangeo, Bia, and Leilei!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Go for the Gold</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race up to 8 friends or randoms to decide who's the fastest athlete of all time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you maintain Absolute Momentum?</p>",
